Quota Tray is a merge of two first-party MIT projects:

  - kimi-planbar-tray (https://github.com/shawn-0106t/kimi-planbar-tray)
    Tray skeleton, panel/settings/skills/menu windows, WebView2 recovery,
    and the Kimi quota endpoint + credential-loading logic.

  - deepseek-planbar (https://github.com/shawn-0106t/deepseek-planbar)
    DeepSeek balance/usage endpoints, parsing rules, credential and cache
    layout, and the in-app WebView2 sign-in capture.

Upstream attribution carried over from those projects:

  - The Kimi quota-endpoint and credential-loading logic derives from
    kimi-planbar (https://github.com/baigong-ai/kimi-planbar),
    Copyright (c) 2026 baigong-ai, used under the MIT License.

  - Additional Kimi quota handling derives from KimiCodeBar,
    Copyright (c) 2026 xifandev, used under the MIT License.

  - The DeepSeek private usage-endpoint shape was verified against
    DeepSeekMonitorWindows (MIT) source; no code was copied.

Both parent projects and this repository are unofficial tools. They are not
affiliated with Kimi (Moonshot AI) or DeepSeek.
